:4}}]},{"fancy_title":"GrokBot Linux Execution on Local Computer not working","id":170157,"title":"GrokBot Linux Execution on Local Computer not working","slug":"grokbot-linux-execution-on-local-computer-not-working","posts_count":2,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number":5,"image_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_1024x305.png","created_at":"2026-09-01T03:38:08.038Z","last_posted_at":"2026-09-01T05:46:50.863Z","bumped":true,"bumped_at":"2026-09-01T05:46:50.863Z","archetype":"regular","unseen":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"Where does the bug appear (feature/product)?\nGrok Bot \nDescribe the Bug\nTime: 2026-09-01 11:10 SGT / 03:10 UTC \nListMachines: {“machines”:} now, after restart, after full GUI kill, and on a new agent (LocalExec probe 74a\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"thumbnails":[{"max_width":null,"max_height":null,"width":1047,"height":312,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc.png"},{"max_width":1024,"max_height":1024,"width":1024,"height":305,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_1024x305.png"},{"max_width":1000,"max_height":1000,"width":1000,"height":297,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_1000x297.png"},{"max_width":800,"max_height":800,"width":800,"height":238,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_800x238.png"},{"max_width":750,"max_height":750,"width":750,"height":223,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_750x223.png"},{"max_width":600,"max_height":600,"width":600,"height":178,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_600x178.png"},{"max_width":500,"max_height":500,"width":500,"height":148,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_500x148.png"},{"max_width":400,"max_height":400,"width":400,"height":119,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_400x119.png"},{"max_width":300,"max_height":300,"width":300,"height":89,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_300x89.png"},{"max_width":200,"max_height":200,"width":200,"height":59,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/2/d2df95cae64a1def3d61c32b49bdaf45bcc5b6cc_2_200x59.png"}],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":82,"category_id":6,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"Original Poster","user":{"id":135503,"username":"Chen_Zhanfeng","name":"Chen Zhanfeng","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png","trust_level":0}},{"extras":"latest","description":"Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":87436,"username":"Colin","name":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_group_id":42,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":3}}]}],"summarizable":false,"has_cached_summary":false,"valid_reactions":["heart","+1","crossed_fingers","clap","laughing","open_mouth","confetti_ball","hugs","heavy_plus_sign","heart_eyes","sunglasses","cursor"],"accepted_answers":[{"id":496256,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T09:01:40.317Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/codercurtis\"\u003e@codercurtis\u003c/a\u003e, thanks, that log confirms it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe helper process that runs commands on your computer needs a newer C++ runtime library (libstdc++) than Ubuntu 22.04 ships, so it fails to start every time and your machine never shows up as connected. Chat keeps working because it doesn’t use that helper. Nothing in your settings or account is wrong.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo ways to get local execution going today:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOption 1 (quick, keeps Ubuntu 22.04):\u003c/strong\u003e upgrade just the libstdc++ library from Ubuntu’s official toolchain PPA. This is a system library change, so only do it if you’re comfortable with that. It’s backward compatible and doesn’t need a reboot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode class=\"lang-auto\"\u003esudo add-apt-repository ppa:ubuntu-toolchain-r/test\nsudo apt update\nsudo apt install --only-upgrade libstdc++6\n\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThen fully quit Grok Bot (make sure the process is gone) and reopen it. After about 30 seconds, ask the agent to run \u003ccode\u003ehostname\u003c/code\u003e on this computer. If it works, you’re set. If not, please send \u003ccode\u003etail -n 20 ~/.grokbot/local-exec-daemon.log\u003c/code\u003e again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOption 2:\u003c/strong\u003e upgrade to Ubuntu 24.04, which ships a new enough library. Grok Bot local execution works there without any extra steps.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":11,"topic_id":172307,"url":"/t/grok-bot-local-execution-never-connects-listmachines-connected-false-while-desktop-chat-works/172307/11","accepter_name":"","accepter_username":"codercurtis"}],"has_accepted_answer":true,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":false,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":87436,"username":"Colin","name":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_color":"","flair_bg_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":3},{"id":138698,"username":"codercurtis","name":"","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/73ab20/{size}.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":0}],"created_by":{"id":138698,"username":"codercurtis","name":"","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/73ab20/{size}.png"},"last_poster":{"id":87436,"username":"Colin","name":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png"}},"bookmarks":[]}